# Benchmark v2 tracked source and generated/private boundaries. These rules are
# last so the curated fixture FASTAs and nested lock override global patterns.
# Comparator environment definitions are flat. Ignore any nested local
# materialization, except curated fixture trees that the static audit tracks.

# flat pre-v2 manuscript and its generated renders remain ignored.
